# Daikibo Data Analytics Portfolio

A portfolio of work completed for the **Data Analytics Job Simulation** issued by Forage, including manufacturing telemetry analysis and an equality-score review.

## Project overview

This project brings together two analysis tasks:

1. **Factory telemetry:** Analyze unhealthy machine status messages by factory and device type, then present the results in a Tableau dashboard.
2. **Compensation equality:** Classify each factory and job-role equality score so records with stronger pay-equality concerns are easy to identify.

